kill hits. Good when supporting an ATK carry.","stats":"ATK%/ER · Cryo · CR/CD"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Team ATK buff after Burst; choose when no ally holds this set.","stats":"ATK%/ER · Cryo · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Hell's Kitchenette","members":["Escoffier","Skirk","Furina","Vodyanitsa"],"text":"Skirk leads Cryo damage while Furina and Vodyanitsa provide Hydro support. Escoffier heals and provides strong Cryo/Hydro RES shred.","roles":["Healer","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Grand MasterChef","members":["Escoffier","Varka","Prune","Shenhe"],"text":"Varka leads with Prune and Shenhe supporting. Escoffier heals and applies Cryo, but mixed elements reduce her RES shred.","roles":["Healer","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Ice Guys Finish Last","members":["Escoffier","Wriothesley","Xiangling","Bennett"],"text":"Wriothesley drives Cryo damage while Xiangling enables Melt. Bennett buffs ATK; Escoffier heals and adds off-field Cryo.","roles":["Healer","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"We Have Skirk at Home","members":["Escoffier","Kaeya","Xingqiu","Rosaria"],"text":"Kaeya drives Cryo damage, Xingqiu provides Hydro and Rosaria adds Cryo. Escoffier heals and maintains full Cryo/Hydro RES shred.","roles":["Healer / Sub DPS","On-field Cryo","Hydro support","Cryo Sub DPS"]}],"v":"Pure Cryo / Hydro: Combine strong off-field Cryo damage, healing, and full Cryo/Hydro resistance reduction.\nTeam ATK Buffer: Sacrifice some personal damage to increase the active damage dealer’s output.\nMelt Flex: A flexible Cryo application and healing option outside pure Cryo/Hydro teams.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support"],"about":"Escoffier heals with her Burst, deals Cryo damage off-field, and reduces Cryo and Hydro resistance. Her full shred is strongest in teams made entirely of Cryo and Hydro characters; other teams sacrifice some of that bonus.","pros":["Strong RES shred","Reliable healing","Good off-field damage","Excellent Cryo support"],"cons":["Team restrictive","Cryo/Hydro focused","Wants some ER","Restricted RES shred"],"weapons":["Symphonist of Scents","Engulfing Lightning","Calamity Queller","Fractured Halo","Staff of Homa","Favonius Lance","Tamayuratei no Ohanashi","Deathmatch"],"arts":[{"sets":["Golden Troupe"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Sub DPS"},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["ATK% / ER","Cryo DMG / ATK%","CR / CD"],"stats":["ER: Team-based","CR: 60–75%","CD: 140–200%+","ATK: Team-based"],"vars":[{"title":"Pure Cryo / Hydro","role":"Healer / Sub DPS","weapons":["Symphonist of Scents","Calamity Queller","Fractured Halo"],"arts":[{"sets":["Golden Troupe"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% or ER / Cryo / CRIT.","teams":"All teammates Cryo or Hydro for maximum shred.","when":"Combine strong off-field Cryo damage, healing, and full Cryo/Hydro resistance reduction.","cond":"Full shred requires only Cryo/Hydro party members","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Team ATK Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Symphonist of Scents","Engulfing Lightning","Tamayuratei no Ohanashi"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Meet ER to use Burst, then ATK and CRIT.","teams":"ATK-scaling carry; do not duplicate support sets.","when":"Sacrifice some personal damage to increase the active damage dealer’s output.","cond":"Tenacity favors recurring Skill hits","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Melt Flex","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Symphonist of Scents","Staff of Homa","Deathmatch"],"arts":[{"sets":["Golden Troupe"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Cryo / CRIT with enough ER.","teams":"Pyro damage dealer; accept reduced RES shred.","when":"A flexible Cryo application and healing option outside pure Cryo/Hydro teams.","cond":"Less Cryo/Hydro RES shred in mixed teams","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Shivada Jade Sliver","Shivada Jade Fragment","Shivada Jade Chunk","Shivada Jade Gemstone","Secret Source Airflow Accumulator","Teachings of Justice","Guide to Justice","Philosophies of Justice","Meshing Gear","Mechanical Spur Gear","Artificed Dynamic Gear","Beryl Conch","Eroded Horn","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Hell's Kitchenette","members":["Escoffier","Skirk","Furina","Vodyanitsa"]},{"name":"Grand MasterChef","members":["Escoffier","Varka","Prune","Shenhe"]},{"name":"Ice Guys Finish Last","members":["Escoffier","Wriothesley","Xiangling","Bennett"]},{"name":"We Have Skirk at Home","members":["Escoffier","Kaeya","Xingqiu","Rosaria"]}]}}],"title":"Escoffier","el":"Cryo"}